Q: Custom Name for Formbuilder Reactive Form - Angular 7 A: <p>Consider formGroup as a normal JavaScript object, its key is its control name:</p>
<pre><code>const thisIsInvalid = {  My Account: 'Account Name'}

const thisIsValid = {'My Account': 'Account Name'}

return this.fb.group(
      {
        'My Account': [ '', [Validators.required]]
        }
    );
</code></pre>
<p>So changing the key name from myAccount to My Account will give an error but changing key name from myAccount to 'My Account' won't.</p>
